<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/eng@/~sched_2__chp_V__para_23> <https://schema.org/text> "The Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Chapter, is amended by inserting after subsection 30(1) the following subsection: “(1a) For the purposes of this section, a chargeable person shall furnish to the Director General a return in the prescribed form on an electronic medium or by way of electronic transmission in accordance with section 82a.”. Amendment of section 30a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/eng@> .
