<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/eng@/~sched_2__chp_V__para_24> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "24" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/eng@> .
